#50250
"Palace Courtyard"
"To the north lies a wide, dark tunnel and the city of Voaleth; the palace
courtyard stretches out in all other directions.  The courtyard is paved with
red bricks; surprising in this rocky cavern.  There is no plant life around
here, or anything else to brighten the atmosphere; though several life-like
statues are placed in the corners of the courtyard.
"
